WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.930
Affliction, that's a tough word.

2
00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.210
I mean, it's scripture.

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.050
So we're going to,
we're talking about it.

4
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.090
We're considering it.

5
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.330
We're spending time with
God wrestling with it.

6
00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:14.330
But the reality is, man,
who wants to be afflicted?

7
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.130
Who's like, man, when I grow
up, I want to be afflicted?

8
00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.450
No, I don't want that.

9
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.610
And so there's a part of us,
I think just humanity of us, it's

10
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.970
like, man, we don't want that.

11
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.950
And yet sometimes we have to
deal with the reality of that.

12
00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:33.620
Affliction, anyway,
that thorn in our side,

13
00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:38.260
that thing that just we can't
quite shake or can't quite get rid

14
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.660
of, whatever that looks like.

15
00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.540
An affliction could
be an attitude.

16
00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:46.100
An affliction could be
just a simple belief.

17
00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:50.420
Affliction could be bitterness
and resentment and hostility.

18
00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.620
It is all sorts of things.

19
00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.960
But let me tell you this.

20
00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.540
Or ask you this, what if
you thought about affliction

21
00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:05.050
the same way you thought about
a really heavy barbell in

22
00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:05.900
the gym.

23
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.990
In other words, what if you
thought about affliction as load

24
00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:12.690
in your life?

25
00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:18.530
And that in some way,
some supernatural way

26
00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:22.000
that God uses that load to

27
00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:28.490
deepen and strengthen your
faith by revealing areas

28
00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:32.240
and places where you
need more of him.

29
00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:35.250
Jesus, we love you.

30
00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.330
God, we're grateful for you.

31
00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:40.370
Lord, we just want
to be joyful in hope.

32
00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.850
And God, we want to be
patient in affliction.

33
00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:45.810
Lord, we could sit here today
and we want to wish bitterness

34
00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:48.130
away. We want to
wish jealousy away.

35
00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.650
We want to wish anger away.

36
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.810
We want to wish addiction away.

37
00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:55.250
Lord, we want to wish envy gone.

38
00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.050
We want to, whatever it is,
Lord, we want the new job.

39
00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.250
We want to be cancer free.

40
00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:00.050
God, all these things.

41
00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.780
We just want… and Lord,

42
00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:08.890
we want to be patient in
affliction and God faithful in

43
00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:13.930
prayer. And so, Lord,
thank you that you are working

44
00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:17.770
even in seasons where it feels
like all we're doing is waiting.

45
00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.802
In Jesus' name, amen.

